.TH "GIT\-COAUTHOR" "1" "November 2026" "" "Git Extras"
.SH "NAME"
\fBgit\-coauthor\fR \- Add a co\-author to the last commit
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
\fBgit coauthor\fR <co\-author> <co\-author\-email>
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Add a co\-author to the last commit
.SH "OPTIONS"
<co\-author>
.P
The username of the co\-author you want to add\.
.P
<co\-author\-email>
.P
The email address of the author you want to add\.
.SH "EXAMPLES"
Add a co\-author to the last commit:
.IP "" 4
.nf
# 1\. Setup a commit
$ git commit \-m "Implement authentication"

# 2\. Add co\-author
$ git coauthor "Jane Doe" jane@example\.com

# 3\. Verify the amended commit message
$ git log \-n 1 \-\-format="%B"
